<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Femcotec audit opinion qualified - JSE.</title>
<headline>Femcotec audit opinion qualified - JSE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said on Wednesday that the audit opinion on Femco Technology Holdings Ltd's annual financial statements had been qualified.</p>
<p>The brief announcement gave no reasons for the qualification.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
